  "job_B9.6.6_20251003_115103": {
    "chunk_text": "de Theodor biscop \u00feone geleafan \u00fe\u00e6re cirican Constantinopoli \u00feurh Ond he \u00f0a wilnade, \u00fe\u00e6t he Ongol\u00feeode cirican, \u00fe\u00e6m he \u00f0a fore w\u00e6s, from \u00feisses gemetes woole Ond gesomnedum \u00fereate arwyr\u00f0ra biscopa & monigra lareowa on syndrige fr\u00e6gn & ascode, & \u00feeosne geleafan he gemde bebeodan & gef\u00e6stnian mid seono\u00f0lecum stafum to intimbernesse \u00deara stafa & gewrites is \u00fees fruma. In nomine Domini nostri Ihesu Cristi Saluatoris: in noman usses Drihtnes H\u00e6lendes Cristes, We asetton, swa swa usser Drihten H\u00e6lende Crist in menniscum lichoman sealde his Ond he sealde haligra f\u00e6dra herebeacen, id est Credo; ond gem\u00e6nelice ealle halige & ealle \u00d0as we seondon arf\u00e6stlice fylgende & rihtwuldriende; \u00e6fter heora lare \u00fea \u00f0e w\u00e6ron Ond we ondetta\u00f0 \u00e6fter halgum f\u00e6drum sw\u00e6slice & so\u00f0lice, F\u00e6der & Sunu & Haligne Gast, Ond \u00feisses gemetes men \u00e6fter setton & spr\u00e6con, \u00fea \u00f0e belumpon to ondetnesse rihtes geleafan. & \u00feas swelce eac to\u00e6tecte se halga seono\u00f0 his stafum: We onfengon \u00fea halgan fif seono\u00f0as & \u00fea Ond we onfengon eac \u00feone seono\u00f0, se w\u00e6s geworden in Rome byrig in Martinus tiide \u00fe\u00e6s Ond we wuldria\u00f0 usserne Drihten H\u00e6lendne Crist, swa swa \u00feas wuldredon, noht to\u00e6tecende Ond we am\u00e6nsumia\u00f0 mid heortum & mid mu\u00f0e, \u00fea \u00f0e heo am\u00e6nsumedon: ond \u00fea \u00f0",
